<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian March inflation slows to 1.5 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Austrian March inflation slows to 1.5 pct y/y.</headline>
<text>
<p>VIENNA, April 28, Reuter - The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	    March	February    March 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index rise	 0.1	  0.4	     0.5</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	     1.5	  1.8	     1.8</p>
<p> Index			    101.2	 101.1	   130.2</p>
<p>NOTE -- Data for March 1997 are provisional. The index for March and February 1997 is based on 1996 = 100, while the March 1996 figure is based on 1986 = 100.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
